.SH NAME
.PP
gemini-markets-stream - Real-time WebSocket streams


.SH SYNOPSIS
.PP
\fBgemini-markets stream [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Subscribe to real-time market data via WebSocket.

.PP
Streams run until interrupted (Ctrl+C). Data is output as JSON, one message per line.

.PP
Examples:
  gemini-markets stream ticker GEMI-NBA-LAL-BOS
  gemini-markets stream trades GEMI-NBA-LAL-BOS
  gemini-markets stream depth GEMI-NBA-LAL-BOS


.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for stream


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
.PP
\fB--debug\fP[=false]
	enable debug logging

.PP
\fB--no-websocket\fP[=false]
	disable WebSocket and use REST API only

.PP
\fB-o\fP, \fB--output\fP="json"
	output format: json, table, or csv

.PP
\fB-q\fP, \fB--quiet\fP[=false]
	suppress stderr output for pure JSON piping

.PP
\fB--raw\fP[=false]
	output compact JSON without pretty-printing

.PP
\fB--sandbox\fP[=false]
	use sandbox environment

.PP
\fB--timeout\fP=30
	request timeout in seconds

.PP
\fB--verbose\fP[=false]
	use full field names in JSON output (default: abbreviated)


